ABSTRACT
In recent years, with the rapid development of urban subway and the exploitation and utilization of underground space, the distance between the new tunnel and the existing tunnel is getting closer and closer, which is easy to cause excessive disturbance and deformation of the existing tunnel. If not controlled, it may not only have a devastating impact on the tunnel, but also pose a serious security threat to personnel. In view of the problems of the existing shield tunnel construction risk assessment, such as weak pertinity and weak foresight, this paper relies on the phase I project of Chengdu Line 30, adopts the means of theoretical analysis and field measurement to carry out the research on the construction risk assessment and control of shield tunnel under existing buildings in mudstone formation. Through deep learning, intelligent optimization algorithm and multi-source data fusion, the intelligent prediction of surface settlement and construction risk dynamic prediction of shield tunnel are carried out. The main research contents of this paper are as follows: (1) The experimental data in this paper are from the phase I project of Chengdu Rail Transit Line 30. The geological and hydrological conditions of the research section are analyzed, and the key and difficult points of shield tunnel construction under mudstone stratum are put forward. The interval from Shunfeng Village Station to Shiyang Station was selected as the test section for intelligent prediction of surface settlement, and the influence parameters of surface settlement measured before or during tunnel excavation were selected as the input variables of the prediction model. The collected data set is preprocessed, and the correlation between the factors affecting the surface settlement is analyzed according to the processed data. Among them, the tunnel coverage depth and geological conditions are most closely related to the surface settlement. (2) According to the statistical results of literature cases, combined with the systematic thought of "man-machine-environment-management", 29 main influencing factors of shield tunnel construction risk were identified from five aspects, including geological condition risk, tunnel design risk, underpass building risk, shield construction control risk and construction site management risk, and corresponding evaluation index system was established. A combined weight calculation method based on fuzzy analytic hierarchy process (AHP) and entropy weight method is established, and risk assessment is carried out in combination with the risk cloud map of cloud model theory. This method has both the subjective experience advantage of experts and the objective advantage of measured data, and the evaluation results are highly accurate and targeted. And the corresponding risk control measures are adopted according to the division of risk grade of the project interval. (3) According to the data set collected in the test section, four kinds of surface settlement prediction models of shield tunnel based on common deep learning algorithms are established. After comparison, the CNN-LSTM combination model with strong performance is selected, and three simple, fast and intelligent optimization algorithms are introduced to optimize the CNN-LSTM combination model, and the fusion intelligent prediction model based on the intelligent optimization algorithm and the CNN-LSTM combination model is established. By comparison, the result of the fusion intelligent prediction model of Sparrow optimization algorithm (SAA) and CNN


