LSTM combination model is more accurate and can better guide the actual engineering construction. (4) According to the prediction results of surface settlement, the cloud model theory and improved D-S evidence theory are used to predict the dynamic risk of shield tunnel construction. The results show that the shield tunnel construction risk assessment model based on surface settlement fusion intelligent prediction can predict the risk level more accurately, and can realize timely adjustment of the forecast results with the realtime update of monitoring and measurement data, and improve the prospective assessment results.
